% F06-CODE: DEFECT 6, THE CODE WINDOW, AS PHASE 7 WIDENED IT.  A CALL IS
% JSB W^ WHILE THE WORD IS WITHIN R8+7FFF AND JSB L^ PAST IT; THE HEADER
% HOLDS A LONGWORD DISPLACEMENT; THE CODE REGION ENDS AT K_END, CODE_0 +
% 4012D (RKERNEL.MAP), A PAGE BEFORE THE END OF THE PSECT, WHERE ENTER SAYS
% "CODE SPACE FULL."  CODE_0 IS R8-8000.
HEX
0 'LOWCP VARIABLE
CODE_PNTR @ LOWCP !
0 R8@+ 8000 + 10 - CODE_PNTR !
'W2 : 77 ;
"W2 " MSG W2 = CR
'W1 : 1 2 + 3 4 + 5 6 + 7 8 + + + + ;
"W1 " MSG W1 = CR
'W3 : W1 W2 + ;
"W3 " MSG W3 = CR
'W2 WHERE CR 'W1 WHERE CR 'W3 WHERE CR
0 R8@+ 8000 - 40100 + CODE_PNTR !
'W4 : W3 W1 + ;
"W4 " MSG W4 = CR
'W4 WHERE CR
"CP " MSG CODE_PNTR @ <#> TYPE CR
'M7 MODULE
'W8 : W4 W4 + ;
"W8 " MSG W8 = CR
M7 FORGET
"CP " MSG CODE_PNTR @ <#> TYPE CR
0 R8@+ 8000 - 40300 + CODE_PNTR !
'W9 : 1 2 + 3 4 + 5 6 + 7 8 + + + + ;
"W9" MSG CR
LOWCP @ CODE_PNTR !
'W5 : W4 W2 + ;
"W5 " MSG W5 = CR
'W5 WHERE CR
"AFTER" MSG CR
